    "long_instructions": "##Crafting Conditionals with Flowcharts\r\n\r\nUse this AI Chat to learn about ways that you can construct flowcharts that model decision-making processes.\r\n\r\nYour flowchart will model something that is personally relevant in your life.\r\n",
